# Netlify redirects — proxy the API and admin dashboard to the Render backend
# so the browser stays same-origin (no CORS) and ApiClient's BASE='/api' works.
#
# 1) Deploy the backend first (see DEPLOY.md), then copy its URL, e.g.
#      https://escape-room-api.onrender.com
# 2) Replace BACKEND_URL below with that URL (no trailing slash).
# 3) Re-run `npm run build` and re-drop client/dist on Netlify.
#
# Until you set BACKEND_URL, the proxy simply fails and the game runs fully
# offline (single-player) — which is the correct Phase-1 behaviour.

/api/*    BACKEND_URL/api/:splat     200
/admin    BACKEND_URL/admin/         200
/admin/*  BACKEND_URL/admin/:splat   200
